        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Upgrades:</strong> 2</p><hr /><p>Eyeswide detectives use this advanced @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.equipment.Item.Baton]{Baton} to subdue unruly perpetrators nonlethally. The handle gives the wielder a very mild electrical shock each time it's picked up or unsheathed, so agents tend to wear insulated gloves when they think a <em>stun stick</em> might be needed on a case.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Short, Sharp Shock</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span></p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The length of the baton becomes wreathed in electrical energy that can temporarily wreak havoc on a creature's motor skills. Make a melee Strike with the stun stick. On a hit, you deal electricity damage instead of bludgeoning damage, and the target must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:20|options:inflicts:stunned|traits:incapacitation] save or become @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 1} for 1 round; this is an incapacitation effect.</p>"
        },
